            "size": 9095,
            "text": "{\"data\":[{\"id\":\"lp6d949\",\"primaryHotelId\":null,\"name\":\"Meliá Lisboa Aeroporto\",\"hotelDescription\":\"\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eLuxurious Accommodations\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eExperience the perfect blend of comfort and style in our air-conditioned rooms with modern amenities and a touch of elegance.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eCulinary Delights\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eIndulge in a delicious breakfast buffet and savor regional and international cuisine at our à la carte restaurant. Don't forget to unwind with a drink at our trendy lounge bar.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eRelaxation and Wellness\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eRecharge your batteries at El Spa with swimming pools, hot tub, sauna, and more. Stay fit with full specialist support at the gym. Unwind knowing your vehicle is safe in our indoor and outdoor parking with electrical charging stations.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eBook now for a memorable stay at Meliá Lisboa Aeroporto Hotel, just a stone's throw away from Lisbon International Airport.\\u003c/p\\u003e\",\"hotelTypeId\":204,\"chainId\":1082,\"chain\":\"Meliá Hotels \\u0026 Resorts\",\"currency\":\"EUR\",\"country\":\"pt\",\"city\":\"Lisbon\",\"latitude\":38.770549,\"longitude\":-9.125638,\"address\":\"Aeroporto Internacional de Lisboa\",\"zip\":\"1700-008\",\"main_photo\":\"https://static.cupid.travel/hotels/415694517.jpg\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://static.cupid.travel/hotels/thumbnail/415694517.jpg\",\"stars\":4,\"rating\":9,\"reviewCount\":11975,\"facilityIds\":[492,47,107,2,109,11,301,8,3,5,20,80,28,4,48,91,49,17,51,7,81,64,25,6,63,10,43,55,54,108,104,118,158,140,185,117,195,103,177,166,167,189,220,203,205,218,257,304,425,465,422,424,463,406],\"accessibilityAttributes\":{\"attributes\":null,\"showerChair\":null,\"entranceType\":null,\"petFriendly\":\"\",\"rampAngle\":0,\"rampLength\":0,\"entranceDoorWidth\":0,\"roomMaxGuestsNumber\":0,\"distanceFromTheElevatorToTheAccessibleRoom\":0},\"deletedAt\":null},{\"id\":\"lp65571137\",\"primaryHotelId\":null,\"name\":\"Lumen Hotel \\u0026 The Lisbon Light Show\",\"hotelDescription\":\"\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eLuxurious Accommodation with Unique Light Show\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eImmersive Light Experience\\u003c/strong\\u003e: Witness a captivating daily videomapping show in the interior garden.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eModern Amenities\\u003c/strong\\u003e: Enjoy air-conditioned rooms with top-notch facilities and a buffet breakfast each morning.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eRelaxation and Convenience\\u003c/strong\\u003e: Unwind at the outdoor pool, sun terrace, and fitness center, complemented by a 24-hour front desk.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eExperience the magic of light and luxury at Lumen Hotel \\u0026amp; The Lisbon Light Show. Book now for an unforgettable stay in Lisbon!\\u003c/p\\u003e\",\"hotelTypeId\":204,\"chainId\":13519,\"chain\":\"Fatima Hotels Group\",\"currency\":\"EUR\",\"country\":\"pt\",\"city\":\"Lisbon\",\"latitude\":38.729584,\"longitude\":-9.14559,\"address\":\"20 Rua Sousa Martins\",\"zip\":\"1050-217\",\"main_photo\":\"https://static.cupid.travel/hotels/325387714.jpg\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://static.cupid.travel/hotels/thumbnail/325387714.jpg\",\"stars\":4,\"rating\":9.6,\"reviewCount\":3632,\"facilityIds\":[492,47,107,2,16,109,11,301,8,3,5,20,80,15,28,14,48,91,17,51,7,81,78,64,25,44,6,23,43,108,161,104,118,158,110,140,143,181,129,124,133,185,101,120,176,117,194,182,177,147,199,192,220,203,221,210,209,205,200,304,455,450,451,449,462,457,461,425,459,467,460,465,468,422,456,453,454,423,458,464,488,418,485,421,420,463],\"accessibilityAttributes\":{\"attributes\":null,\"showerChair\":null,\"entranceType\":null,\"petFriendly\":\"\",\"rampAngle\":0,\"rampLength\":0,\"entranceDoorWidth\":0,\"roomMaxGuestsNumber\":0,\"distance