uring Fado and Jazz add to the entertainment options during the stay.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eConvenient Services\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWith a 24-hour reception, the hotel offers services ranging from restaurant reservations to laundry and dry cleaning. Guests can also arrange for airport shuttle transfers and explore nearby attractions like Augusta Street for shopping and dining experiences.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eBook your stay at Santa Justa Hotel for a luxurious and convenient experience in Lisbon.\\u003c/p\\u003e\",\"hotelTypeId\":204,\"chain\":\"Not Available\",\"currency\":\"EUR\",\"country\":\"pt\",\"city\":\"Lisbon\",\"latitude\":38.712541,\"longitude\":-9.137983,\"address\":\"Rua dos Correeiros, 204\",\"zip\":\"1100-170\",\"main_photo\":\"https://static.cupid.travel/hotels/492226771.jpg\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://static.cupid.travel/hotels/thumbnail/492226771.jpg\",\"stars\":4,\"rating\":9.4,\"reviewCount\":4087,\"facilityIds\":[47,107,2,16,109,8,3,5,20,80,28,48,22,91,49,17,51,7,81,78,64,25,44,75,23,43,55,54,21,108,127,158,184,140,129,124,185,176,117,186,187,189,222,203,210,209,219,205,304,455,450,451,449,462,457,461,425,459,467,460,465,468,422,456,454,424,423,421,487,420,410,407],\"accessibilityAttributes\":{\"attributes\":null,\"showerChair\":null,\"entranceType\":null,\"petFriendly\":\"\",\"rampAngle\":0,\"rampLength\":0,\"entranceDoorWidth\":0,\"roomMaxGuestsNumber\":0,\"distanceFromTheElevatorToTheAccessibleRoom\":0},\"deletedAt\":null},{\"id\":\"lp6660b\",\"primaryHotelId\":null,\"name\":\"MYRIAD by SANA Hotels\",\"hotelDescription\":\"\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eLuxurious Accommodations with Panoramic Views\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eExperience contemporary design Rooms and Suites at MYRIAD by SANA, offering unparalleled panoramic views of the Tagus River or Parque das Nações.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eExceptional Dining and Relaxation Options\\u003c/strong\\u003e\