t Dining and Stunning Views\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eIndulge in a culinary journey at Rossio Gastrobar with its unique menu of shareable dishes, signature cocktails, and fine wines, all while enjoying breathtaking views of Lisbon and the Tagus River. Start your day with a delicious breakfast buffet on the 7th floor overlooking Liberdade Avenue.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eConvenience and Elegance Combined\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eBenefit from 24-hour front desk service, a business center, and meeting rooms at the Altis Avenida Hotel. Additional services like laundry, dry cleaning, and car rental ensure a seamless stay. Explore nearby attractions like Rossio Station, Chiado, and Bairro Alto within walking distance.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eBook now for an unforgettable experience at Altis Avenida Hotel!\\u003c/p\\u003e\",\"hotelTypeId\":204,\"chain\":\"Not Available\",\"currency\":\"EUR\",\"country\":\"pt\",\"city\":\"Lisbon\",\"latitude\":38.715194,\"longitude\":-9.140877,\"address\":\"Rua 1º De Dezembro, 120\",\"zip\":\"1200-360\",\"main_photo\":\"https://static.cupid.travel/hotels/363671179.jpg\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://static.cupid.travel/hotels/thumbnail/363671179.jpg\",\"stars\":5,\"rating\":9.2,\"reviewCount\":3316,\"facilityIds\":[47,107,2,16,109,11,8,3,5,20,15,28,4,48,22,91,51,7,81,64,25,44,6,75,23,43,21,52,108,118,158,184,180,143,124,142,218,217,455,450,451,449,462,457,425,459,422,418,404,420],\"accessibilityAttributes\":{\"attributes\":null,\"showerChair\":null,\"entranceType\":null,\"petFriendly\":\"\",\"rampAngle\":0,\"rampLength\":0,\"entranceDoorWidth\":0,\"roomMaxGuestsNumber\":0,\"distanceFromTheElevatorToTheAccessibleRoom\":0},\"deletedAt\":null}],\"hotelIds\":[\"lp6d949\",\"lp65571137\",\"lpaf35b\",\"lp36b7f\",\"lp74dd5\",\"lp9fdca\",\"lp6a139\",\"lp6660b\",\"lp210af\",\"lpc6f3a\",\"lp3072a\",\"lp1d6171\",\"lp87311\",\"lp2d220\",\"lp57165\",\"lp1eeced\",\"lp6931e\",\"lp6