            "text": "{\"data\":[{\"id\":\"lpa86b6\",\"primaryHotelId\":null,\"name\":\"Palácio das Especiarias\",\"hotelDescription\":\"\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eHistoric Luxury in the Heart of Lisbon\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eLuxurious Accommodation\\u003c/strong\\u003e: Stay in air-conditioned rooms with free WiFi, including exclusive royal suites and superior suites with stunning views.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eCultural Exploration\\u003c/strong\\u003e: Explore the vibrant neighborhood with popular attractions like Chiado, Bairro-Alto, Commerce Square, Rossio, and São Jorge Castle.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eLive Music Breakfast\\u003c/strong\\u003e: Start your day with a continental breakfast accompanied by live music, creating a unique and memorable experience.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eExperience the charm of a former palace, modern amenities, and a prime location - book your stay at Palácio das Especiarias now!\\u003c/p\\u003e\",\"hotelTypeId\":216,\"chain\":\"Not Available\",\"currency\":\"EUR\",\"country\":\"pt\",\"city\":\"Lisbon\",\"latitude\":38.710207,\"longitude\":-9.144265,\"address\":\"Rua da Horta Seca 11\",\"zip\":\"1200-221\",\"main_photo\":\"https://static.cupid.travel/hotels/466006977.jpg\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://static.cupid.travel/hotels/thumbnail/466006977.jpg\",\"stars\":4,\"rating\":9.5,\"reviewCount\":5438,\"facilityIds\":[492,47,107,16,109,11,8,80,15,14,48,91,17,51,7,10,55,54,71,108,118,158,110,140,143,117,147,203,221,210,209,219,304,455,450,462,457,461,425,459,467,465,468,422,423,418,421,408,410,406],\"accessibilityAttributes\":{\"attributes\":null,\"showerChair\":null,\"entranceType\":null,\"petFriendly\":\"\",\"rampAngle\":0,\"rampLength\":0,\"entranceDoorWidth\":0,\"roomMaxGuestsNumber\":0,\"distanceFromTheElevatorToTheAccessibleRoom\":0},\"deletedAt\":null},{\"id\":\"lp42d92\",\"primaryHotelId\":null,\"name\":\"Vincci Baixa Suites Apartments\",\"hotelDescription\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eDiscover the charm of Vincci Baixa Suites Apartments, where modern comfort meets the heart of Lisbon.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003ePrime Location\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eSituated just 1.1 miles from the city center, our hotel allows you to explore iconic landmarks like Commerce Square and St. George's Castle, all within a short stroll.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eSpacious Accommodations\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eEnjoy well-appointed suites featuring a kitchen equipped with a microwave, fridge, and minibar, along with a cozy seating area, air conditioning, and a flat-screen TV for your relaxation.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eExceptional Service\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWith a 24-hour front desk and convenient amenities like an elevator, we ensure every aspect of your stay is seamless and enjoyable, allowing you to focus on what matters most—making unforgettable memories.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eBook your stay today to experience the finest in Lisbon hospitality!\\u003c/p\\u003e\",\"hotelTypeId\":219,\"chainId\":1114,\"chain\":\"Vincci Hoteles\",\"currency\":\"EUR\",\"country\":\"pt\",\"city\":\"Lisbon\",\"latitude\":38.709307,\"longitude\":-9.135474,\"address\":\"Rua Do Comercio 32-38\",\"zip\":\"1100-150\",\"main_photo\":\"https://static.cupid.travel/hotels/743905562.jpg\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://static.cupid.travel/hotels/thumbnail/743905562.jpg\",\"stars\":4,\"rating\":0,\"reviewCount\":96,\"facilityIds\":[47,107,2,16,109,8,80,48,51,64,108,158,455,450,451,461,425,465,422,456,452,423,418,421],\"accessibilityAttributes\":{\"attributes\":null,\"showerChair\":null,\"entranceType\":null,\"petFriendly\":\"\",\"rampAngle\":0,\"rampLength\":0,\"entranceDoorWidth\":0,\"roomMaxGuestsNumber\":0,\"distanceFromTheElevatorToTheAccessibleRoom\":0},\"deletedAt\":null},{\"id\":\"lp6e0aa\",\"primaryHotelId\":null,\"name\":\"Torel Palace Lisbon\",\"hotelDescription\":\"\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eLuxurious Accommodation\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eTorel Palace Lisbon offers 33 beautifully decorated rooms and suites, each equipped with modern amenities and stylish furnishings, ensuring a comfortable stay for every guest.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eGastronomic Delights\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eIndulge in a culinary journey at the hotel's elegant 2Monkeys restaurant or unwind at the Black Pavilion restaurant and bar, offering a diverse selection of delectable dishes and drinks.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eConvenient Location and Services\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eLocated in the heart of Lisbon, guests can easily explore the city's attractions with proximity to popular landmarks and transportation options. Additionally, the hotel provides a range of services including airport shuttle, babysitting, and concierge assistance for a seamless stay.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eExperience the epitome of luxury and convenience at Torel Palace Lisbon. Book now for an unforgettable stay!\\u003c/p\\u003e\",\"hotelTypeId\":216,\"chain\":\"Not Available\",\"currency\":\"EUR\",\"country\":\"pt\",\"city\":\"Lisbon\",\"latitude\":38.717821,\"longitude\":-9.14004,\"address\":\"Rua Câmara Pestana, 23\",\"zip\":\"1150-082\",\"main_photo\":\"https://static.cupid.travel/hotels/501094710.jpg\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://static.cupid.travel/hotels/thumbnail/501094710.jpg\",\"stars\":5,\"rating\":9.4,\"reviewCount\":1666,\"facilityIds\":[492,47,107,2,16,109,11,301,8,3,5,80,15,28,14,4,48,22,91,49,17,51,7,81,78,44,75,23,43,55,54,21,52,79,108,161,104,118,127,158,110,184,140,181,129,124,133,176,117,142,194,182,183,199,222,220,203,221,210,209,205,218,236,241,226,257,254,217,231,232,255,256,304,455,450,451,449,462,457,461,425,459,467,465,468,422,453,419,454,423,458,486,488,485,421,487,404,484],\"accessibilityAttributes\":{\"attributes\":null,\"showerChair\":null,\"entranceType\":null,\"petFriendly\":\"\",\"rampAngle\":0,\"rampLength\":0,\"entranceDoorWidth\":0,\"roomMaxGuestsNumber\":0,\"distanceFromTheElevatorToTheAccessibleRoom\":0},\"deletedAt\":null},{\"id\":\"lp3533e\",\"primaryHotelId\":null,\"name\":\"VIP Executive Eden Aparthotel\",\"hotelDescription\":\"\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003ePanoramic Views and Central Location\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eEnjoy breathtaking panoramic views over Lisbon from our terrace bar at VIP Executive Eden Aparthotel, centrally located in Baixa Pombalina. Explore Lisbon's Old Town with ease as the airport bus stops right outside, only 20 minutes away.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eSpacious Studios and Apartments\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eRelax in our large studios and apartments, each equipped with a working area and modern kitchens. Unwind with amenities like TV, air conditioning, internet access, and a private bathroom for your comfort.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eRooftop Pool and Awards\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eTake a dip in our seasonal rooftop swimming pool or savor daily breakfast. Recognized for its unique design, VIP Executive Eden Aparthotel was awarded \\u0026quot;The Best Urban Renovation Project,\\u0026quot; just 10 minutes from Sta. Apolónia train station. Don't miss the vibrant Bairro Alto, just a 10-minute walk away.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eBook your stay now at VIP Executive Eden Aparthotel for an unforgettable Lisbon experience.\\u003c/p\\u003e\",\"hotelTypeId\":219,\"chainId\":1113,\"chain\":\"VIP Hotels\",\"currency\":\"EUR\",\"country\":\"pt\",\"city\":\"Lisbon\",\"latitude\":38.715495,\"longitude\":-9.14209,\"address\":\"Praça dos Restauradores, 24\",\"zip\":\"1250-187\",\"main_photo\":\"https://static.cupid.travel/hotels/344061461.jpg\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://static.cupid.travel/hotels/thumbnail/344061461.jpg\",\"stars\":4,\"rating\":8.1,\"reviewCount\":7546,\"facilityIds\":[47,107,16,109,301,8,5,80,15,28,48,91,51,7,64,25,44,23,43,108,104,158,110,124,185,120,176,117,111,194,186,177,188,199,189,222,203,219,205,455,450,451,449,462,457,461,425,459,467,460,465,468,422,456,452,453,454,423,458,486,488,485,421,487,484,420],\"accessibilityAttributes\":{\"attributes\":null,\"showerChair\":null,\"entranceType\":null,\"petFriendly\":\"\",\"rampAngle\":0,\"rampLength\":0,\"entranceDoorWidth\":0,\"roomMaxGuestsNumber\":0,\"distanceFromTheElevatorToTheAccessibleRoom\":0},\"deletedAt\":null},{\"id\":\"lp327d8\",\"primaryHotelId\":null,\"name\":\"Legendary Lisboa Suites\",\"hotelDescription\":\"\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eLuxurious Self-Catering Accommodation\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eClarion Suites in Lisbon offers stylish self-catering accommodation with designer furnishings and modern amenities. Guests can enjoy spacious rooms and apartments with flat-screen TVs and Wi-Fi access.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eOutdoor Swimming Pool and Dining Options\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eThe hotel features an outdoor swimming pool for guests to relax and unwind. Guests can also choose to prepare their own meals in the fully-equipped kitchenettes, order room service, or indulge in the daily breakfast buffet. The Clarion Lobby Bar offers a selection of Portuguese wines and spirits.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eConvenient Location and Parking\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eLocated in the heart of Lisbon, just a few minutes' walk from Praça Marquês de Pombal, the hotel is conveniently situated near Rato Metro Station. Additionally, guests can benefit from the hotel's private parking garage for added convenience.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eExperience luxury and convenience at Clarion Suites Lisboa. Book your stay now!\\u003c/p\\u003e\",\"hotelTypeId\":219,\"chain\":\"Not Available\",\"currency\":\"EUR\",\"country\":\"pt\",\"city\":\"Lisbon\",\"latitude\":38.722543,\"longitude\":-9.152756,\"address\":\"Rua Rodrigo da Fonseca, 44-50\",\"zip\":\"1250-193\",\"main_photo\":\"https://static.cupid.travel/hotels/516302498.jpg\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://static.cupid.travel/hotels/thumbnail/516302498.jpg\",\"stars\":4,\"rating\":8.5,\"reviewCount\":4708,\"facilityIds\":[47,107,2,46,16,109,301,8,5,20,80,15,28,14,48,22,91,17,51,7,81,78,64,25,44,75,23,43,73,53,21,108,161,104,118,158,184,140,143,181,129,124,159,101,120,176,117,194,182,135,183,177,199,222,220,203,221,219,205,214,304,455,450,451,449,462,457,461,425,459,467,460,465,468,422,456,452,466,453,419,454,423,458,486,464,488,418,485,421,487,484,420,463,401],\"accessibilityAttributes\":{\"attributes\":null,\"showerChair\":null,\"entranceType\":null,\"petFriendly\":\"\",\"rampAngle\":0,\"rampLength\":0,\"entranceDoorWidth\":0,\"roomMaxGuestsNumber\":0,\"distanceFromTheElevatorToTheAccessibleRoom\":0},\"deletedAt\":null},{\"id\":\"lp572dc\",\"primaryHotelId\":null,\"name\":\"Altis Prime Hotel\",\"hotelDescription\":\"\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eModern 4-Star Lisbon Aparthotel\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eThis modern 4-star Lisbon aparthotel is less than 10 minutes' walk from Marquês de Pombal and Avenida da Liberdade. It offers self-catering suites and features a rooftop terrace with a large hot tub and panoramic city views.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eLuxurious Suites and Amenities\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eSuites at the Altis Prime Hotel have parquet floors and luxury bedding. They include stylish furnishings and come equipped with cable LCD TV and a kitchenette with a toaster and Nespresso coffee machine.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eConvenient Services and Nearby Attractions\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eAltis Prime's Lounge Caffé is open every day and is the ideal spot for breakfast or a drink at any time. The hotel offers a 24-hour front desk service. Located near Marques de Pombal Station, guests can easily explore high-end shops on Avenida da Liberdade and historic sites like Rossio Square and the Castle of São Jorge.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eBook your stay at Altis Prime Hotel for a delightful Lisbon experience.\\u003c/p\\u003e\",\"hotelTypeId\":219,\"chain\":\"Not Available\",\"currency\":\"EUR\",\"country\":\"pt\",\"city\":\"Lisbon\",\"latitude\":38.720352,\"longitude\":-9.150857,\"address\":\"Rua Rodrigo da Fonseca, 4\",\"zip\":\"1250-191\",\"main_photo\":\"https://static.cupid.travel/hotels/25538077.jpg\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://static.cupid.travel/hotels/thumbnail/25538077.jpg\",\"stars\":4,\"rating\":9.1,\"reviewCount\":1974,\"facilityIds\":[47,107,2,16,109,8,5,80,15,28,4,48,22,91,17,51,7,81,64,25,44,6,75,23,43,21,108,161,118,127,158,110,140,143,129,124,133,185,176,186,177,203,210,209,219,205,218,217,304,455,450,451,449,462,457,461,425,459,467,460,465,468,422,453,454,423,486,421,487,420],\"accessibilityAttributes\":{\"attributes\":null,\"showerChair\":null,\"entranceType\":null,\"petFriendly\":\"\",\"rampAngle\":0,\"rampLength\":0,\"entranceDoorWidth\":0,\"roomMaxGuestsNumber\":0,\"distanceFromTheElevatorToTheAccessibleRoom\":0},\"deletedAt\":null},{\"id\":\"lp5cc1d\",\"primaryHotelId\":null,\"name\":\"Lisbon Art Stay Hotel \\u0026 Apartments\",\"hotelDescription\":\"\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eConvenient Location in Lisbon\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eLuxurious Amenities\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eGuests at Lisbon Art Stay Apartments Baixa can enjoy a continental breakfast and free WiFi. The air-conditioned units feature modern conveniences such as a flat-screen TV, a well-equipped kitchen, and a private bathroom. The apartment also offers family rooms and facilities for disabled guests, ensuring comfort for all visitors.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eDiverse Dining and Services\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWith a coffee shop and bar on-site, guests can unwind and socialize in a cozy setting. Additionally, the apartment complex provides a car rental service for convenient exploration of the city. For dining options, various restaurants are within walking distance, offering a taste of local cuisine.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eNear Major Attractions\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eSituated near iconic landmarks like Commerce Square and St. George's Castle, Lisbon Art Stay Apartments Baixa is the perfect base for sightseeing. Book now to experience the ultimate blend of luxury and convenience during your Lisbon getaway.\\u003c/p\\u003e\",\"hotelTypeId\":201,\"chain\":\"Not Available\",\"currency\":\"EUR\",\"country\":\"pt\",\"city\":\"Lisbon\",\"latitude\":38.711775,\"longitude\":-9.138544,\"address\":\"Rua dos Sapateiros 158\",\"zip\":\"1100-580\",\"main_photo\":\"https://static.cupid.travel/hotels/454091452.jpg\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://static.cupid.travel/hotels/thumbnail/454091452.jpg\",\"stars\":4,\"rating\":9,\"reviewCount\":5953,\"facilityIds\":[47,107,16,109,8,3,80,28,48,91,51,7,25,6,75,108,129,147,203,219,304,455,450,451,449,462,457,461,425,459,467,465,468,422,456,452,466,453,419,424,423,486,488,485,421,487,484,420,410,407],\"accessibilityAttributes\":{\"attributes\":null,\"showerChair\":null,\"entranceType\":null,\"petFriendly\":\"\",\"rampAngle\":0,\"rampLength\":0,\"entranceDoorWidth\":0,\"roomMaxGuestsNumber\":0,\"distanceFromTheElevatorToTheAccessibleRoom\":0},\"deletedAt\":null},{\"id\":\"lpb965e\",\"primaryHotelId\":null,\"name\":\"Dear Lisbon - Gallery House\",\"hotelDescription\":\"\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eCharming Bed and Breakfast in the Heart of Lisbon\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eConvenient Location\\u003c/strong\\u003e: Dear Lisbon - Gallery House is ideally situated near popular attractions like Bairro Alto and Estrela Garden, offering easy access to the city's landmarks.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eComfortable Accommodation\\u003c/strong\\u003e: Enjoy modern amenities such as free WiFi, flat-screen TVs, and air conditioning in well-appointed rooms with city views and private bathrooms.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eDelightful Dining and Shopping\\u003c/strong\\u003e: Indulge in a buffet breakfast and explore nearby cafes and eateries. For shopping enthusiasts, Liberty Avenue is a short walk away, featuring upscale stores and boutiques.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eReady to experience Lisbon in style? Book your stay at Dear Lisbon - Gallery House now for a memorable getaway.\\u003c/p\\u003e\",\"hotelTypeId\":208,\"chain\":\"Not Available\",\"currency\":\"EUR\",\"country\":\"pt\",\"city\":\"Lisbon\",\"latitude\":38.710869,\"longitude\":-9.15274,\"address\":\"Rua de São Bento, 31\",\"zip\":\"1200-815\",\"main_photo\":\"https://static.cupid.travel/hotels/117163594.jpg\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://static.cupid.travel/hotels/thumbnail/117163594.jpg\",\"stars\":4,\"rating\":9.4,\"reviewCount\":1233,\"facilityIds\":[47,107,16,109,80,15,48,91,17,51,7,64,75,21,108,127,158,110,140,145,124,222,203,304,455,450,451,449,462,457,461,425,459,467,460,465,468,422,456,466,453,419,423,458,421,404],\"accessibilityAttributes\":{\"attributes\":null,\"showerChair\":null,\"entranceType\":null,\"petFriendly\":\"\",\"rampAngle\":0,\"rampLength\":0,\"entranceDoorWidth\":0,\"roomMaxGuestsNumber\":0,\"distanceFromTheElevatorToTheAccessibleRoom\":0},\"deletedAt\":null},{\"id\":\"lpa8794\",\"primaryHotelId\":null,\"name\":\"The Lumiares Hotel \\u0026 Spa - Small Luxury Hotels Of The World\",\"hotelDescription\":\"\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eRooftop Views and Cultural Surroundings\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eExperience the vibrant Bairro Alto district with stunning rooftop views of the River Tagus and Castelo de São Jorge.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eLuxurious Accommodation\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eIndulge in modern amenities such as flat-screen TVs, kitchenettes with a dishwasher, and private bathrooms in each unit.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eRelaxation at Its Best\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eUnwind at the on-site bar or book a pampering session at the spa for a truly rejuvenating stay.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eBook now to immerse yourself in the charm of Lisbon at The Lumiares Hotel \\u0026amp; Spa - Small Luxury Hotels Of The World.\\u003c/p\\u003e\",\"hotelTypeId\":219,\"chain\":\"Not Available\",\"currency\":\"EUR\",\"country\":\"pt\",\"city\":\"Lisbon\",\"latitude\":38.71387,\"longitude\":-9.14445,\"address\":\"Rua do Diario de Noticas, 142\",\"zip\":\"1200-146\",\"main_photo\":\"https://static.cupid.travel/hotels/137239477.jpg\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://static.cupid.travel/hotels/thumbnail/137239477.jpg\",\"stars\":5,\"rating\":0,\"reviewCount\":853,\"facilityIds\":[492,47,107,2,16,109,11,8,3,5,20,80,15,28,4,70,48,22,91,17,51,7,81,78,86,64,25,44,75,69,10,23,43,82,55,61,90,54,21,79,108,158,184,140,181,129,124,133,159,185,176,117,182,186,222,203,219,218,236,226,257,217,231,232,256,304,455,450,451,449,462,457,461,425,459,467,465,422,452,453,454,423,458,486,464,488,418,485,421,487,404,484,420,405,408,463,410,406,411,400,409,403,402],\"accessibilityAttributes\":{\"attributes\":null,\"showerChair\":null,\"entranceType\":null,\"petFriendly\":\"\",\"rampAngle\":0,\"rampLength\":0,\"entranceDoorWidth\":0,\"roomMaxGuestsNumber\":0,\"distanceFromTheElevatorToTheAccessibleRoom\":0},\"deletedAt\":null},{\"id\":\"lp65590778\",\"primaryHotelId\":null,\"name\":\"Martinhal Lisbon Oriente\",\"hotelDescription\":\"\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eLuxurious Amenities\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eExperience luxury with an outdoor swimming pool, fitness centre, and private parking.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eScenic Views\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eEnjoy pool and river views and the proximity to Lisbon Oceanarium.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eFamily-Friendly Experience\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eIndulge in spa facilities, indoor pool, and family activities like a kids' club and children's playground.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eTo book your relaxing getaway at Martinhal Lisbon Oriente, inquire now.\\u003c/p\\u003e\",\"hotelTypeId\":201,\"chain\":\"Not Available\",\"currency\":\"EUR\",\"country\":\"pt\",\"city\":\"Lisbon\",\"latitude\":38.761582,\"longitude\":-9.098131,\"address\":\"Praça Príncipe Perfeito\",\"zip\":\"1990-221\",\"main_photo\":\"https://static.cupid.travel/hotels/466945356.jpg\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://static.cupid.travel/hotels/thumbnail/466945356.jpg\",\"stars\":5,\"rating\":9.8,\"reviewCount\":297,\"facilityIds\":[47,107,2,16,109,11,301,8,3,5,20,80,15,28,14,48,22,91,49,17,51,7,81,78,64,25,44,75,56,23,73,29,54,21,52,108,161,104,118,127,158,184,140,170,181,129,124,133,159,185,176,117,142,182,103,186,172,183,177,174,144,189,125,222,220,203,221,210,209,219,258,254,214,256,304,455,450,451,449,462,457,461,425,459,467,465,468,422,452,454,424,423,418,485,421,487,404,405,410,411,400],\"accessibilityAttributes\":{\"attributes\":null,\"showerChair\":null,\"entranceType\":null,\"petFriendly\":\"\",\"rampAngle\":0,\"rampLength\":0,\"entranceDoorWidth\":0,\"roomMaxGuestsNumber\":0,\"distanceFromTheElevatorToTheAccessibleRoom\":0},\"deletedAt\":null},{\"id\":\"lp218a14\",\"primaryHotelId\":null,\"name\":\"Luzeiros Suites\",\"hotelDescription\":\"\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eLuxurious Sustainable Accommodation in the Heart of Lisbon\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eModern Amenities\\u003c/strong\\u003e: Luzeiros Suites offers soundproof rooms, a restaurant, 24-hour front desk, and free WiFi. Family rooms and facilities for disabled guests are available.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eComfortable Stay\\u003c/strong\\u003e: Air-conditioned units with a desk, coffee machine, fridge, safety deposit box, flat-screen TV, and private bathroom with a shower. Some units have a seating area and balcony.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eDelicious Dining\\u003c/strong\\u003e: Enjoy buffet and à la carte breakfast options with fresh pastries, champagne, and pancakes every morning. Don't forget to visit the on-site coffee shop for a delightful treat.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eExperience the perfect blend of comfort and sustainability at Luzeiros Suites. Book now for an unforgettable stay in Lisbon!\\u003c/p\\u003e\",\"hotelTypeId\":216,\"chain\":\"Not Available\",\"currency\":\"EUR\",\"country\":\"pt\",\"city\":\"Lisbon\",\"latitude\":38.741449,\"longitude\":-9.147037,\"address\":\"Avenida da Republica, 77\",\"zip\":\"1050-243\",\"main_photo\":\"https://static.cupid.travel/hotels/266463231.jpg\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://static.cupid.travel/hotels/thumbnail/266463231.jpg\",\"stars\":4,\"rating\":8.4,\"reviewCount\":5898,\"facilityIds\":[47,107,16,109,8,3,80,28,48,91,17,51,81,64,25,6,108,127,158,110,140,129,124,185,176,186,188,187,189,222,203,210,209,219,304,455,450,449,461,425,459,467,465,468,422,452,454,423,486,418,485,421,487,420],\"accessibilityAttributes\":{\"attributes\":null,\"showerChair\":null,\"entranceType\":null,\"petFriendly\":\"\",\"rampAngle\":0,\"rampLength\":0,\"entranceDoorWidth\":0,\"roomMaxGuestsNumber\":0,\"distanceFromTheElevatorToTheAccessibleRoom\":0},\"deletedAt\":null},{\"id\":\"lp80d51\",\"primaryHotelId\":null,\"name\":\"Casa do Principe\",\"hotelDescription\":\"\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eLuxurious Accommodation\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eCasa do Príncipe offers spacious and sunny rooms and suites, each adorned with intricate stuccowork ceilings, real hardwood floors, and authentic frescos. Enjoy a comfortable stay with flat-screen TVs, cable channels, and private bathrooms in every unit. Some rooms even boast picturesque views of the garden or city, providing a tranquil retreat in the heart of Lisbon.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eDining and Entertainment\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eIndulge in traditional Portuguese gastronomy at nearby signature restaurants, or take a short walk to the vibrant Bairro Alto neighborhood for a lively nightlife experience. With a variety of bars in the area, guests can unwind and savor a drink after a day of exploring the city.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eConvenient Location\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eLocated just minutes away from popular attractions like Liberdade Avenue, Chiado shopping area, and São Jorge Castle, Casa do Príncipe offers a prime location for exploring Lisbon's rich culture and history. Book your stay now and experience the charm of this elegant B\\u0026amp;B.\\u003c/p\\u003e\",\"hotelTypeId\":208,\"chain\":\"Not Available\",\"currency\":\"EUR\",\"country\":\"pt\",\"city\":\"Lisbon\",\"latitude\":38.716954,\"longitude\":-9.148797,\"address\":\"Praça do Principe Real 23, 1st Floor\",\"zip\":\"1250-184\",\"main_photo\":\"https://static.cupid.travel/hotels/50209608.jpg\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://static.cupid.travel/hotels/thumbnail/50209608.jpg\",\"stars\":4,\"rating\":9,\"reviewCount\":799,\"facilityIds\":[47,107,2,16,109,80,28,48,22,91,17,51,81,44,23,21,108,158,180,140,129,124,203,304,455,450,451,449,462,457,461,459,467,465,468,422,453,454,423,464,488,421,420],\"accessibilityAttributes\":{\"attributes\":null,\"showerChair\":null,\"entranceType\":null,\"petFriendly\":\"\",\"rampAngle\":0,\"rampLength\":0,\"entranceDoorWidth\":0,\"roomMaxGuestsNumber\":0,\"distanceFromTheElevatorToTheAccessibleRoom\":0},\"deletedAt\":null}],\"hotelIds\":[\"lpa86b6\",\"lp42d92\",\"lp6e0aa\",\"lp3533e\",\"lp327d8\",\"lp572dc\",\"lp5cc1d\",\"lpb965e\",\"lpa8794\",\"lp65590778\",\"lp218a14\",\"lp80d51\"],\"total\":6025}"
