eAs of 1st January 2019 and according to information of the Lisbon City Hall, city tax will be increased. It will continue to be charged per guest (13+ years old) until a maximum of 7 nights. The present rates do not include this tax, which shall be paid directly by the guest to the hotel.\\u003cbr/\\u003eThe Shuttle service is unavailable until further notice.\\u003cbr/\\u003eAltis Prime Hotel is now a Dog Friendly Hotel. The hotel accommodates dogs with a maximum weight of 10 kg (this information must be indicated in advance). €15 will be charged per night, per pet (Only one pet is allowed per stay).\\u003cbr/\\u003eRates and conditions valid only for individual bookings. 3 or more rooms will be considered group and rates/conditions may change.\\u003cbr/\\u003eThe hotel may charge City Taxes or a Resort Fee, paid directly at the hotel\\u003cbr/\\u003eBaby cot subject to availability and may have an additional cost.\\u003cbr/\\u003eNote that some hotels may require cash or credit card deposit as guarantee. This will be returned on departure minus any deduction incurred during the stay.\\u003cbr/\\u003eDouble/Twin beds are subject to hotel availability.\\u003cbr/\\u003e\",\"priceType\":\"commission\",\"commission\":[{\"amount\":0,\"currency\":\"USD\"}],\"retailRate\":{\"total\":[{\"amount\":964.4,\"currency\":\"USD\"}],\"suggestedSellingPrice\":[{\"amount\":1002.01,\"currency\":\"USD\",\"source\":\"booking.com\"}],\"initialPrice\":[{\"amount\":964.4,\"currency\":\"USD\"}],\"taxesAndFees\":[{\"included\":false,\"description\":\"As per information of the local authorities, city tax will be charged  in Lisbon, 4€ per night and per person with more than 13 years, up to a maximum of 7 nights. Tax to be paid directly at the hotel (subject to change)\",\"amount\":27.72,\"currency\":\"USD\"}]},\"cancellationPolicies\":{\"cancelPolicyInfos\":[{\"cancelTime\":\"2026-10-23 10:00:00\",\"amount\":964.4,\"currency\":\"USD\",\"type\":\"amount\",\"timezone\":\"GMT\"},{\"cancelTime\