w RO - NRF\",\"maxOccupancy\":2,\"adultCount\":2,\"childCount\":0,\"childrenAges\":[],\"boardType\":\"RO\",\"boardName\":\"Room Only\",\"remarks\":\"\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003ePlease be informed that Hotel Mundial will be undergoing renovation works until November 2028.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cbr/\\u003eAs of 1st January 2019 and according to information of the Lisbon City Hall, city tax will be increased. It will continue to be charged per guest (13+ years old) until a maximum of 7 nights. The present rates do not include this tax, which shall be paid directly by the guest to the hotel.\\u003cbr/\\u003ePHC Hotels has a new app through which you can pre-check in and take advantage of all hotel services. Download PHC Hotels App from App Store (https://apps.apple.com/us/app/id1523449661) or Play Store (https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.guestu.phchotels)\\u003cbr/\\u003eNo Show Fee: 100% charged.\\u003cbr/\\u003eCheck-in is available from 3pm.\\u003cbr/\\u003eRates and conditions valid only for individual bookings. 3 or more rooms will be considered group and rates/conditions may change.\\u003cbr/\\u003eThe hotel may charge City Taxes or a Resort Fee, paid directly at the hotel\\u003cbr/\\u003eBaby cot subject to availability and may have an additional cost.\\u003cbr/\\u003eNote that some hotels may require cash or credit card deposit as guarantee. This will be returned on departure minus any deduction incurred during the stay.\\u003cbr/\\u003eDouble/Twin beds are subject to hotel availability.\\u003cbr/\\u003e\",\"priceType\":\"commission\",\"commission\":[{\"amount\":0,\"currency\":\"USD\"}],\"retailRate\":{\"total\":[{\"amount\":643.6,\"currency\":\"USD\"}],\"suggestedSellingPrice\":[{\"amount\":840.54,\"currency\":\"USD\",\"source\":\"booking.com\"}],\"initialPrice\":[{\"amount\":643.6,\"currency\":\"USD\"}],\"taxesAndFees\":[{\"included\":false,\"description\":\"As per information of the local authorities, city tax will be charged  in Lisbon,