ifferent areas of the building: Phase 1 July to November 2024, Ground Floor. Phase 2 Nov 2024 to Mar 2025 Restaurants, Terrace, Meeting Rooms and Gym, Phase 3 from 2025 to 2027 Guest Rooms. To minimize the impact works will take place mon to sat 10:00 am to 6:00 pm only\\u003cbr/\\u003e5 rooms or more for the same dates will be considered as a group, and the hotel will have the right to reject it or to confirm them at different rates and conditions.Group reservations are considered to be those reservations or blocks made by the agency for 5 rooms or more, having the same or several locations/origin, with identical creation date or made on different dates and the dates of stay of the reservations coincide on several or all days. Therefore, in these situations, the hotel reserves the right not to accept these reservations, being necessary to confirm the price and availability of these rooms expressly by the hotel and after the quotation of availability and prices through the group department.\\u003cbr/\\u003eTourist City taxes and Resort Fees to be paid on the spot, if any\\u003cbr/\\u003eNote that some hotels may require cash or credit card deposit as guarantee. This will be returned on departure minus any deduction incurred during the stay.\\u003cbr/\\u003e\",\"priceType\":\"commission\",\"commission\":[{\"amount\":0,\"currency\":\"USD\"}],\"retailRate\":{\"total\":[{\"amount\":702.74,\"currency\":\"USD\"}],\"suggestedSellingPrice\":[{\"amount\":870.7,\"currency\":\"USD\",\"source\":\"booking.com\"}],\"initialPrice\":[{\"amount\":702.74,\"currency\":\"USD\"}],\"taxesAndFees\":[{\"included\":false,\"description\":\"City tax\",\"amount\":27.6,\"currency\":\"USD\"},{\"included\":false,\"description\":\"VAT\",\"amount\":42.16,\"currency\":\"USD\"}]},\"cancellationPolicies\":{\"cancelPolicyInfos\":[],\"hotelRemarks\":[],\"refundableTag\":\"NRFN\"},\"paymentTypes\":[\"NUITEE_PAY\"],\"providerCommission\":{\"amount\":0,\"currency\":\"\"},\"perks\":[],\"promotions\":null}],