t Fees to be paid on the spot, if any\\u003cbr/\\u003eNote that some hotels may require cash or credit card deposit as guarantee. This will be returned on departure minus any deduction incurred during the stay.\\u003cbr/\\u003e\",\"priceType\":\"commission\",\"commission\":[{\"amount\":0,\"currency\":\"USD\"}],\"retailRate\":{\"total\":[{\"amount\":895.26,\"currency\":\"USD\"}],\"suggestedSellingPrice\":[{\"amount\":1109.22,\"currency\":\"USD\",\"source\":\"booking.com\"}],\"initialPrice\":[{\"amount\":895.26,\"currency\":\"USD\"}],\"taxesAndFees\":[{\"included\":false,\"description\":\"City tax\",\"amount\":27.6,\"currency\":\"USD\"},{\"included\":false,\"description\":\"VAT\",\"amount\":53.72,\"currency\":\"USD\"}]},\"cancellationPolicies\":{\"cancelPolicyInfos\":[],\"hotelRemarks\":[],\"refundableTag\":\"NRFN\"},\"paymentTypes\":[\"NUITEE_PAY\"],\"providerCommission\":{\"amount\":0,\"currency\":\"\"},\"perks\":[],\"promotions\":null}],\"offerRetailRate\":{\"amount\":895.26,\"currency\":\"USD\"},\"suggestedSellingPrice\":{\"amount\":1109.22,\"currency\":\"USD\",\"source\":\"booking.com\"},\"offerInitialPrice\":{\"amount\":895.26,\"currency\":\"USD\"},\"priceType\":\"commission\",\"rateType\":\"standard\",\"paymentTypes\":[\"NUITEE_PAY\"]},{\"roomTypeId\":\"GE3DSOBNGEZTKMZUGN6E4USGJZ6DEMBSGYYDSMJUGEYDAMD4GE2HYURRGIZTS7BYHE2TENQ\",\"offerId\":\"_-\",\"supplier\":\"nuitee\",\"supplierId\":2,\"rates\":[{\"rateId\":\"\",\"occupancyNumber\":1,\"name\":\"Deluxe Room with Balcony and City View\",\"maxOccupancy\":2,\"adultCount\":2,\"childCount\":0,\"childrenAges\":[],\"boardType\":\"BI\",\"boardName\":\"Breakfast Included\",\"remarks\":\"Starting on 01st July of 2024, hotel will have renovations works that will affect, in phases, different areas of the building: Phase 1 July to November 2024, Ground Floor. Phase 2 Nov 2024 to Mar 2025 Restaurants, Terrace, Meeting Rooms and Gym, Phase 3 from 2025 to 2027 Guest Rooms. To minimize the impact works will take place mon to sat