The SPA facilities (including the indoor pool) will be closed for maintenance from 11th to 18th January 2027.\\u003cp\\u003e- Group Bookings: reservations for 5 or more rooms are considered group bookings and may be subject to different guarantee and cancellation policies. Generic names or those marked as “to be confirmed” are not permitted.\\u003cp\\u003e- Touristic Tax: not included and must be paid upon arrival.\\u003cp\\u003e- Stag and hen parties: not allowed. The hotel reserves the right to refuse check-in if such groups arrive.\\u003cp\\u003e- During Summer Music Festivals, a 250 Euro damage refundable deposit per room is requested upon arrival. Guests are required to wear hotel wristbands for identification purposes, and non-hotel guests are not permitted.\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cbr/\\u003eRates and conditions valid only for individual bookings. 3 or more rooms will be considered group and rates/conditions may change.\\u003cbr/\\u003eThe hotel may charge City Taxes or a Resort Fee, paid directly at the hotel\\u003cbr/\\u003eBaby cot subject to availability and may have an additional cost.\\u003cbr/\\u003eNote that some hotels may require cash or credit card deposit as guarantee. This will be returned on departure minus any deduction incurred during the stay.\\u003cbr/\\u003eDouble/Twin beds are subject to hotel availability.\\u003cbr/\\u003e\",\"priceType\":\"commission\",\"commission\":[{\"amount\":0,\"currency\":\"USD\"}],\"retailRate\":{\"total\":[{\"amount\":812.55,\"currency\":\"USD\"}],\"suggestedSellingPrice\":[{\"amount\":934.44,\"currency\":\"USD\",\"source\":\"\"}],\"initialPrice\":[{\"amount\":812.55,\"currency\":\"USD\"}],\"taxesAndFees\":[{\"included\":false,\"description\":\"As per information of the local authorities, city tax will be charged  in Lisbon, 4€ per night and per person with more than 13 years, up to a maximum of 7 nights. Tax to be paid directly at the hotel (subject to change)\",\"amount\":27.72,\"currency\":\"USD\"}]},\"cancellatio