uring the stay.\\u003cbr/\\u003eDouble/Twin beds are subject to hotel availability.\\u003cbr/\\u003e\",\"priceType\":\"commission\",\"commission\":[{\"amount\":0,\"currency\":\"USD\"}],\"retailRate\":{\"total\":[{\"amount\":770.26,\"currency\":\"USD\"}],\"suggestedSellingPrice\":[{\"amount\":933.55,\"currency\":\"USD\",\"source\":\"booking.com\"}],\"initialPrice\":[{\"amount\":770.26,\"currency\":\"USD\"}],\"taxesAndFees\":[{\"included\":false,\"description\":\"As per information of the local authorities, city tax will be charged  in Lisbon, 4€ per night and per person with more than 13 years, up to a maximum of 7 nights. Tax to be paid directly at the hotel (subject to change)\",\"amount\":27.72,\"currency\":\"USD\"}]},\"cancellationPolicies\":{\"cancelPolicyInfos\":[{\"cancelTime\":\"2026-10-24 10:00:00\",\"amount\":256.74,\"currency\":\"USD\",\"type\":\"amount\",\"timezone\":\"GMT\"},{\"cancelTime\":\"2026-10-26 10:00:00\",\"amount\":770.26,\"currency\":\"USD\",\"type\":\"amount\",\"timezone\":\"GMT\"}],\"hotelRemarks\":[],\"refundableTag\":\"RFN\"},\"paymentTypes\":[\"NUITEE_PAY\"],\"providerCommission\":{\"amount\":0,\"currency\":\"\"},\"perks\":[],\"promotions\":null}],\"offerRetailRate\":{\"amount\":770.26,\"currency\":\"USD\"},\"suggestedSellingPrice\":{\"amount\":933.55,\"currency\":\"USD\",\"source\":\"booking.com\"},\"offerInitialPrice\":{\"amount\":770.26,\"currency\":\"USD\"},\"priceType\":\"commission\",\"rateType\":\"package\",\"paymentTypes\":[\"NUITEE_PAY\"]},{\"roomTypeId\":\"GE3TKOJNGIYDENRXGMZXYTSSIZHHYMRQGI3DAOJRGQYTAMBQPQZXYURRGIYTE7BXG4ZTOMQ\",\"offerId\":\"-\",\"supplier\":\"nuitee\",\"supplierId\":2,\"rates\":[{\"rateId\":\"\",\"occupancyNumber\":1,\"name\":\"Double Superior Avenue View Room Package NRF RO\",\"maxOccupancy\":2,\"adultCount\":2,\"childCount\":0,\"childrenAges\":[],\"boardType\":\"RO\",\"boardName\":\"Room Only\",\"remarks\":\"Baby Cot always on request and subject to hotel availability.\\u003cbr/\\u003eAny type of fare does n